  <div class="mt-28 grid max-w-[42rem] gap-12">
    <section>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Deeper means calmer.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose">Equalise early, turn at the depth you planned, and come up with air to spare.</p>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">I certify Molchanovs Wave 1 and Wave 2. Always train with a qualified buddy watching and stay well within your limits.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">One-to-one for kids.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">An instructor stays beside your child the whole time, and each skill is solid before the next one starts. <a href="/junior/" class="font-bold decoration-sky-200 decoration-8">Freediving for kids</a></p>
    </section>
